<p>You fire a shot at your target's throat, mouth, or equivalent body part, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">125%, 140%, 151%, 161%, 170%</acronym> damage and silencing it for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6</acronym> turns.</p><p>The silence chance increases with your Accuracy.</p>